Identifier and schema lineage:

- The namespace is urn:sidged:, the prefix is sdg.*, the capability token
  format is sdg-cap, and media types use application/vnd.sidged.*.
- Layer specifications use identifiers SDG-L0 through SDG-L8.
- Schema $id values are published under https://sidged.com/spec/schemas/.
- The conformance test-vector suite version is 0.3.0.
